flowchart TD
  claude[claude in its terminal] -->|hook event| rcv[Receiver in The Hive]
  rcv --> trk[Status tracker]
  trk --> dot[Status dot and header counts]
  rcv --> ntf[Notifier picks a kind]
  ntf --> pref{Your setting for that kind}
  pref -->|Inbox or Both| card[Inbox card and red badge]
  pref -->|Both| toast[Desktop notification]
  pref -->|Off| none[Nothing]
